From 62d5a487715a19ad186f717c1751a4b15485f4dd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Destrudos6 <3411622425@qq.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 12:59:29 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] 0057: Improve debug log system and add install diagnostics
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Add install diagnostic logging in BisubUpdateChecker: log APK file
  path/size/exists/canRead, FileProvider URI, Intent action/type/flags
  before firing install, and wrap startActivity in try-catch to log
  any exception — helps diagnose '解析软件包时出现问题'
- Log download start and completion in doDownload
- Make debug log text selectable (setTextIsSelectable) so users can
  select and copy specific portions instead of only whole-text copy
- Add 'Upload to cloud' button in debug log dialog: uploads log as
  bisub-debug-log.txt to the configured WebDAV/S3 cloud backup endpoint
- CloudBackupManager.uploadLog method for direct log text upload
- Restructure dialog buttons: Copy (positive), Upload (neutral), Clear (negative)
